| Mathias Buus | 2 |

The list is cut at 12 names. Those lines add up to 229, so about 9 more lines belong to authors not shown.

Without `--ignore-rev`, blame gives Fiona Formatter 32 lines. That is only because of the quote-style changes. Those lines are Troy's and others' original code.

I did not check which of Troy's 159 lines date from 2013 and which from the 2026 annotations. I also did not check whether the same person appears under more than one name or email.

